            "id": "https://openbld.net/kz/blog/openbld-and-unihost-kz-2026/",
            "content_html": "<p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"OpenBLD and Unihost.kz\" src=\"https://openbld.net/kz/assets/images/openbld-and-unihost-kz-2026-2ba9d4d40563d17a264f4bd7a8df2efb.webp\" width=\"1250\" height=\"680\" class=\"img_tFOa\"></p>\n<p>For more than 10 years, OpenBLD and Sys-Adm.in have relied on infrastructure provided by Unihost.kz.</p>\n<!-- -->\n<p>This is the longest-running partnership in OpenBLD’s history. Reliable performance, high-quality network connectivity, and most importantly - the company’s generous, free-of-charge support helped make the launch of the public OpenBLD.net service possible.</p>\n<p>Several servers in Almaty have remained part of our infrastructure throughout this period, including a dedicated uptime monitoring node, supporting both our services and the wider OpenBLD ecosystem.</p>\n<p>More than a decade later, they are still doing their job.</p>\n<p>Thank you, Unihost.kz, for supporting OpenBLD and helping us keep the Internet a little safer 🚀</p>\n<h4 class=\"anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_m4Qy\" id=\"updates\">Updates<a href=\"https://openbld.net/kz/blog/openbld-and-unihost-kz-2026/#updates\" class=\"hash-link\" aria-label=\"Updates-ға тікелей сілтеме\" title=\"Updates-ға тікелей сілтеме\" translate=\"no\">​</a></h4>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"\">Official <a href=\"https://t.me/openbld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">Telegram</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://openbld.net/kz/blog/openbld-and-unihost-kz-2026/",
            "title": "🤝 OpenBLD and Unihost.kz 10y+ Stable Experience",
            "summary": "OpenBLD and Sys-Adm.in have relied on infrastructure provided by Unihost.kz for over 10 years.",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Yevgeniy Goncharov",
                "url": "https://github.com/m0zgen"
            },
            "tags": [
                "openbld",
                "unihost.kz",
                "2026"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "https://openbld.net/kz/blog/openbld-up-dns-doh-dot-apple-profiles/",
            "content_html": "<p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"OpenBLD Up DNS DoH/DoT Apple Profiles\" src=\"https://openbld.net/kz/assets/images/openbld-up-dns-doh-dot-apple-profiles-d179a90d4c0246988ddb977751457ab4.webp\" width=\"1250\" height=\"680\" class=\"img_tFOa\"></p>\n<p>New ADA and RIC Apple configuration profiles have been released, version <code>15.3</code>, improving DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH) and DNS-over-TLS (DoT) support for iOS, iPadOS, and macOS devices.</p>\n<!-- -->\n<h2 class=\"anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_m4Qy\" id=\"how-to-install-apple-dns-profiles\">How to install Apple DNS profiles<a href=\"https://openbld.net/kz/blog/openbld-up-dns-doh-dot-apple-profiles/#how-to-install-apple-dns-profiles\" class=\"hash-link\" aria-label=\"How to install Apple DNS profiles-ға тікелей сілтеме\" title=\"How to install Apple DNS profiles-ға тікелей сілтеме\" translate=\"no\">​</a></h2>\n<p>Profiles tested and compatible with latest iOS, iPadOS, and macOS releases (tested on macOS Tahoe 26.5.2 and iOS 26.6.1).</p>\n<p>Follow instructions in the <a class=\"\" href=\"https://openbld.net/kz/docs/get-started/setup-mobile-devices/apple/\">Apple Devices Setup Guide</a> to install the new profiles.</p>\n<h4 class=\"anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_m4Qy\" id=\"updates\">Updates<a href=\"https://openbld.net/kz/blog/openbld-up-dns-doh-dot-apple-profiles/#updates\" class=\"hash-link\" aria-label=\"Updates-ға тікелей сілтеме\" title=\"Updates-ға тікелей сілтеме\" translate=\"no\">​</a></h4>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"\">Official <a href=\"https://t.me/openbld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"\">Telegram</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://openbld.net/kz/blog/openbld-up-dns-doh-dot-apple-profiles/",
            "title": "↗ OpenBLD Updated DNS DoH/DoT Apple Profiles",
